      "instruction": "Add recombinant IRAK1, a peptide substrate (e.g., MBP), and ATP to each well; incubate under conditions compatible with the ADP‑Glo kit.",
      "parameters": {
        "enzyme_concentration": "5 ng/µL (typical for ADP‑Glo, see manufacturer guidance)",
        "substrate_concentration": "10 µM (saturating for MBP‑based assays)",
